Text: Huang et al. [2] demonstrated the effectiveness of using Convolutional neural network (CNN) with RGB video data for sign language recognition. Three dimensional CNN have been used to extract spatio-temporal features from video [3]. Similar architecture was implemented for Italian gestures [10].

